# Excludes source/config from the packaged .vsix, leaving only dist/ + package.json + readme +
# icon + LICENSE. Patterns are unanchored (no leading `/`) on purpose: a leading-slash version
# (`/webview/**`, `/src/**`, ...) silently matched nothing at all — confirmed via `vsce package`'s
# own file listing, which still showed every excluded path present, unchanged. The unanchored
# form below correctly matches only the top-level `webview/` source dir, not the nested
# `dist/webview/` build output — verified the same way.
src/**
webview/index.html
webview/tsconfig.json
webview/vite.config.ts
webview/src/**
shared/**
tsconfig.json
vitest.config.ts
esbuild.mjs
**/*.test.ts
